---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: countermeasures
navKey: countermeasures
crumbKey: crumb.countermeasures
title: "Countermeasures — Citere"
description: "Every report Citere sent to a platform or registrar about disinformation in AI chatbot answers: the fact, the date and the status, never the correspondence."
schemas:
  - dataset
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/countermeasures/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- set doc = copy.en.countermeasures -%}
<div class="phead"><h1>{{ doc.data.h1 }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ doc.data.lead | fill(figures) | mdInline | safe }}</p></div>

<div class="callout"><b>How we disclose.</b> We notify the platform first and privately. The fact, date
  and status of a report are published immediately; the content of the exchange is not published at all.
  We never publish prompts designed to bypass model safeguards.</div>

<div class="filters" style="margin-top:22px">
  <span class="f active">All actions <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ countermeasures.actions | length }}</span></span>
  {%- for t in actionTypes %}<span class="f">{{ t.label }} <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ t.count }}</span></span>{% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Every logged action, newest first</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">{{ 'col.date' | t }}</th><th scope="col">{{ 'col.type' | t }}</th><th scope="col">{{ 'col.target' | t }}</th>
    <th scope="col">{{ 'col.claim' | t }}</th><th scope="col">{{ 'col.status' | t }}</th><th scope="col">{{ 'col.response' | t }}</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for e in countermeasures.actions | take(60) %}
    {%- set claim = claims | whereEq('id', e.claim_id) | first %}
    <tr><td class="num" style="color:var(--dim)"><time datetime="{{ e.date | isoDate }}">{{ e.date | shortDate }}</time></td>
      <td>{{ e.typeLabel }}{% if e.subtypeLabel %} <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">&middot; {{ e.subtypeLabel }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td>{{ e.target | defangCopy }}</td>
      <td>{% if claim %}<a href="{{ claim.url | url }}" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">{{ e.claim_id }}</a>{% else %}<span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ e.claim_id }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td><span class="chip {{ 'ok' if e.status in ['acknowledged','responded','closed'] else ('wait' if e.status in ['submitted','pending_confirmation'] else '') }}"><span class="dot"></span>{{ e.statusLabel }}</span></td>
      <td class="num" style="color:var(--dimmer)">{% if e.response_date %}<time datetime="{{ e.response_date | isoDate }}">{{ e.response_date | shortDate }}</time>{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table>
  {%- if countermeasures.actions | length > 60 %}
  <div class="summary-line" style="border-bottom:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line2)">
    Showing 60 of {{ countermeasures.actions | length }} actions
    {%- if datasets.has['countermeasures-csv'] %}<a style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" href="{{ '/countermeasures.csv' | url }}">The full log as CSV &rarr;</a>{% endif %}</div>
  {%- endif %}
</div>

<div class="exports" style="margin:18px 0 40px">
  {%- if datasets.has['countermeasures-csv'] %}<a href="{{ '/countermeasures.csv' | url }}">{{ 'action.downloadLog' | t }}</a><span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  <a href="{{ '/methodology/' | url }}">What we do not publish</a></div>
